{'symbol': 'WY', 'date': '2022-10-27 16:15:00', 'title': 'WEYERHAEUSER REPORTS THIRD QUARTER RESULTS', 'text': 'ACHIEVED NET EARNINGS OF $310 MILLION, OR $0.42 PER DILUTED SHARE GENERATED $583 MILLION OF ADJUSTED EBITDA REPURCHASED $404 MILLION OF COMMON SHARES YEAR TO DATE, THROUGH THE THIRD QUARTER SEATTLE , OCT. 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WEYERHAEUSER COMPANY\xa0(NYSE: WY) TODAY REPORTED THIRD QUARTER NET EARNINGS OF\xa0$310 MILLION, OR 42 CENTS\xa0PER DILUTED SHARE, ON NET SALES OF $2.3 BILLION. THIS COMPARES WITH NET EARNINGS OF $482 MILLION, OR 64 CENTS\xa0PER DILUTED SHARE, ON NET SALES OF $2.3 BILLION\xa0FOR THE SAME PERIOD LAST YEAR AND NET EARNINGS OF $788 MILLION FOR THE SECOND QUARTER OF 2022.'}